			<u>Tab.Heracl.</u>
			1.5
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			2.4
		</span></i> : ἡ :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small light shield</i> of leather <i>without a
				rim</i>, orig. Thracian, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.75
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θρῃκίας π. ἄναξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					498
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				783
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				563
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.282.120
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				14
			</span></i>(b)<i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Ἀμαζονική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>body of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πελτασταί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				410
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
